  "question": "Monorail system relation $\\theta=\\tan^{-1}(x/15)$, $x\\ge0$. <br /><br />(a) Describe behavior of $\\theta$.<br /><br />(b) Find $\\sin\\theta$ in terms of $x$.<br /><br />(c) Determine $x$ when $\\theta=45^\\circ$.",
