  "explanation": "(a) As $x\\to0$, $\\theta\\to0$. As $x\\to\\infty$, $\\theta\\to\\pi/2$. Function increases monotonically. <br /><br />(b) $\\sin\\theta=x/\\sqrt{225+x^2}$. <br /><br />(c) If $\\theta=\\pi/4$, then $x/15=1$ so $x=15$ and $\\sin\\theta=1/\\sqrt2$.",
